    10	/**
    11	 * The claim-office adapter: a scenario is read from stdin and its results
    12	 * written to stdout. A refusal by the MHPCO -- an item it does not insure,
    13	 * a damage the policy does not cover, a malformed damage report -- is not a
    14	 * result, so it is reported on stderr and exits non-zero with no results
    15	 * written to stdout.
    16	 */
